  10:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f0xx_ll_bus.h ****     [..]  
  11:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f0xx_ll_bus.h ****       A delay between an RCC peripheral clock enable and the effective peripheral 
